 different things at once: open-source software, a server you can run yourself, and the hosted service we operate. Responsibility differs completely across the three, and this policy binds only the third. That distinction is not wordplay: the statement you accept at sign-up reads “I agree to the terms of service and privacy policy of the server I am connecting to”, and “that server” may be a machine anyone has put in place." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.heyta" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[413,357][1988,409]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.heyta" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[413,430][1988,923]" drawing-order="3" hint="" /><node index="3" text="What you get" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.heyta" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[445,462][1957,510]" drawing-order="4" hint="" /><node index="4" text="The heyta app itself (client code for every platform and the server source code, MIT-licensed, free of charge)" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.heyta" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[445,520][1957,646]" drawing-order="5" hint="" /><node index="5" text="Who processes your data" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.heyta" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[445,678][1957,726]" drawing-order="6" hint="" /><node index="6" text="No one processes anything on your behalf. The code runs on your device and your data stays on your device." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.heyta" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[445,736][1957,862]" drawing-order="7" hint="" /><node index="7" text="Does this policy apply" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.heyta" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[445,894][1957,923]" drawing-order="8" hint="" /><node index="8" text="&#128308; It does not apply. Software does not process anyone’s personal information, and for the same reason it cannot make promises to you." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.heyta" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[445,952][1957,923]" drawing-order="9" hint="" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></hierarchy>